        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 1600F Ball Roller Catch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBall catches are installed in the top, bottom and/or side of the door to hold them closed. An adjustable ball catch, the ball retaining cylinder threads into the catch face plate for 1/2\" of adjustment. They are used in conjunction with door pull type hardware. Supplied with strike plate and mounting hardware, made of solid brass in your choice of 7 finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BC218-Specifications.gif?v=1704354636\" width=\"600\" height=\"190\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BC218 Ball Catch Specifications\">\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 1600F Door Ball Catch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Catch Face Plate Length: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Catch Face Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Catch Face Plate Depth: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustment Length: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 2-1/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Corner Type: Square</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
